3. The following modifications (where applicable) are prescribed for the purposes of section 35(2)(b) of the Act:
(a)except as provided for in paragraph (c), any reference in the Code to a District Court, a State Court or a Magistrate’s Court is a reference to a Youth Court;
(b)any reference in the Code to a District Judge or a Magistrate is a reference to a District Judge or Magistrate who is designated under section 14 of the Act as a judge of a Youth Court;
(c)any reference in the Code to the Registrar of the State Courts is a reference to the Registrar.
